        <description><![CDATA[{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 Select Studio Graphite Console from Options > Themes after installing. ReaImGui 0.10 or later is required for Transport Buttons settings. js_ReaScriptAPI supports both Folder Annexes, app window focus, FTC dockers and Gridbox, and Shift-click iQ. SWS/S&M Extension is required for the mixer Folder Annex and docked Mixer focus. Install the optional docker and Gridbox scripts from the FTC Tools repository. The README has the font downloads and the optional Folder Annex startup setup.\par}
}
]]></description>
